# Copy to .env.prod on the VPS (used by the caddy service in docker-compose.prod.yml)
# — never commit real values.

# The public domain Caddy issues a TLS cert for and proxies to the backend, e.g.
# api.packetpulse.example. Must already point at this VPS's IP in DNS before first
# `docker compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml up -d`, or Caddy's ACME challenge fails.
API_DOMAIN=
